{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1311603-how-does-the-virtue-track-work","id":1311603,"title":"How does the Virtue track work?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-05-12T13:44:10-07:00","id":1311603,"title":"How does the Virtue track work?","content":"I am a bit confused by the Virtue track. You put one Virtue on one end and the other at the opposite end. Where does the track start? In the middle? If you move the track counter closer to that virtue when you do something that is in line with that virtue, doesn't that mean you are lowering dice? <br /> <br /> I assume that you gain a number of extra dice equal to the number of dots you have in the virtue, on top of the one gotten from spending a momentum, when you do something that resonates with that virtue. <br /> <br /> As you can see from the makeup of my question, I am very confused.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2018-bioagent","name":"Bioagent","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2018_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-12T13:58:23-07:00","id":1311606,"title":"","content":"It\u2019s not about filling it, it\u2019s about moving one mark from one side to the other.<br /> <br /> I would start on OOXOO, but the SG could let you start on any other position, XOOOO for example.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-12T14:01:26-07:00","id":1311608,"title":"","content":"Check post 34, 35 and mainly 36 for doubts on Virtues.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1309822-systematic-questions-please-for-the-love-of-gods-help\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1309822-systematic-questions-please-for-the-love-of-gods-help\"> Systematic Questions, PLEASE FOR THE LOVE OF GODS HELP! - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1309822-systematic-questions-please-for-the-love-of-gods-help\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1309822-systematic-questions-please-for-the-love-of-gods-help </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Ok I will have more then this but for now: How does skill selection work in character generation work? The path section says you choose 3 skills but certain of the paths in Origin seem to have a varying amount of selections to choose from (examples being Suburbia having the skills: Culture, Empathy, or Technology vs Chosen which has: Culture, Integrity Occult, or Subterfuge vs Created which just states a flat Athletics, Empathy, Survival). </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-12T14:03:28-07:00","id":1311609,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bioagent</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1311603-how-does-the-virtue-track-work#post1311603\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I am a bit confused by the Virtue track. You put one Virtue on one end and the other at the opposite end. Where does the track start? In the middle? If you move the track counter closer to that virtue when you do something that is in line with that virtue, doesn't that mean you are lowering dice?</div> </div> </div> </div>The track starts in the middle and moves towards the Virtue that you act in accordance with... if you dedicatedly act in line with only one, it moves towards that end faster... if you uphold both Virtues equally you tend to oscillate between them.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bioagent</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1311603-how-does-the-virtue-track-work#post1311603\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I assume that you gain a number of extra dice equal to the number of dots you have in the virtue, on top of the one gotten from spending a momentum, when you do something that resonates with that virtue.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm not sure why you're assuming this, that's not how it works at all... if an action is in line with a Virtue, you may spend a point of momentum to add two dice to it, as opposed to the one die you get on standard actions... if you have a Virtue maxxed out, then you get three dice when you spend momentum on it. You never gain dice automatically.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bioagent</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1311603-how-does-the-virtue-track-work#post1311603\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As you can see from the makeup of my question, I am very confused.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hope that helped.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1344-samudra","name":"Samudra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1344_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"497"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-12T14:51:16-07:00","id":1311614,"title":"","content":"That helps a lot, thanks!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2018-bioagent","name":"Bioagent","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2018_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}